[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Furies</h2>
<i>"Battle is a Test of ones wits and strength...lack in either and you are finished."<br>
--High Priest Helmaster, </i>  

<p>The Furies are angry...they have sent there 3 high priests to put and end to the rebellious priest...and you must stop them...and send them back to the furies."


$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>Congratulations! We have scored a great victory!</h2>
<p>
You have defeated the High Priest's of the Furies...but you fear that they are not yet done with you.....


<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,CursedScen2

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>You Recive a Message!</h2>
<p>
Good WorK...The High Priest of Rain has been defeated...Let us Battle on!!

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>You Recive a Message!</h2>
<p>
The High Priest of Thunder Has been sent back to the Furies...Let us finish off the others!!

[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>You Recive a Message!</h2>
<p>
Good Work!! We are doing well in this battle...Let us crush our opposition!!!

[ai5TempleHalfDead]
<h2>The Rebellious Priest needs your Help!!!!</h2>
<p>
My island is being Destroyed!!! I need your Help to crush these High Priests!!!

[ai5PriestCaptured]
<h2>The Rebellious Priest has been taken!!!</h2>
<p>
You Better go and Help The Rebellious Priest before his blood is spilt on thier altar!!

$Button=Continue,DoNothing

[ai5PriestDead]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
Oh No!!! You let the Furies High Priests take the Rebelious Priest from you...his blood has stained thier altar...and your mission has failed!!

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
You are dead! The Aliens have won and evil has prevailed!

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]